<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<meta name="theme-color" content="#160d35">
<meta name="description" content="RiseUp AI Technologies — Building innovative AI tools and digital experiences. Created by Jahnavi.">
<title>RiseUp AI Technologies</title>

<style>
*{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;padding:0}
body{
font-family:Arial,sans-serif;
background:#100a27;
color:#fff;
line-height:1.6;
}
header{
padding:20px 7%;
display:flex;
justify-content:space-between;
align-items:center;
border-bottom:1px solid #302253;
}
.logo{font-size:21px;font-weight:bold;color:#bda4ff}
.logo span{color:#75d7ff}
nav a{color:#fff;text-decoration:none;margin-left:16px;font-size:14px}
.hero{
min-height:75vh;
padding:90px 7%;
display:flex;
flex-direction:column;
justify-content:center;
align-items:center;
text-align:center;
background:radial-gradient(ellipse at top,#39216e 0%,#100a27 65%);
}
.tag{
border:1px solid #7052b9;
color:#bda4ff;
border-radius:30px;
padding:7px 15px;
font-size:13px;
margin-bottom:25px;
}
h1{font-size:clamp(38px,8vw,66px);line-height:1.12;margin-bottom:22px}
h1 span{
background:linear-gradient(90deg,#c5a7ff,#75d7ff);
-webkit-background-clip:text;
color:transparent;
}
.hero p{max-width:600px;color:#d0c9e2;font-size:17px}
.buttons{display:flex;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap;justify-content:center;margin-top:30px}
.btn{
display:inline-block;padding:13px 22px;border-radius:12px;
text-decoration:none;font-weight:bold;font-size:14px;
}
.primary{background:linear-gradient(90deg,#8b5cf6,#53b9ee);color:#fff}
.secondary{border:1px solid #77639e;color:#fff}
section{padding:65px 7%}
.section-title{text-align:center;font-size:32px;margin-bottom:12px}
.section-desc{text-align:center;color:#b9b0d0;margin-bottom:35px}
.cards{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(220px,1fr));gap:18px}
.card{
padding:25px;border:1px solid #352754;border-radius:18px;
background:#1a1235;
}
.card .icon{font-size:30px;margin-bottom:12px}
.card h3{margin-bottom:9px;color:#c5b1ff}
.card p{font-size:14px;color:#c3bbd5}
.about{
max-width:750px;margin:auto;text-align:center;
background:#1a1235;border:1px solid #352754;border-radius:20px;padding:30px;
}
.about p{color:#c3bbd5;margin-top:12px}
footer{text-align:center;padding:30px 15px;border-top:1px solid #302253;color:#b9b0d0;font-size:13px}
footer strong{color:#c5b1ff}
</style>
</head>

<body>
<header>
  <div class="logo">RiseUp <span>AI</span></div>
  <nav><a href="#home">Home</a><a href="#projects">Projects</a><a href="#about">About</a></nav>
</header>

<main>
<section class="hero" id="home">
  <div class="tag">✦ INNOVATION STARTS HERE</div>
  <h1>Ideas Today.<br><span>Intelligence Tomorrow.</span></h1>
  <p>Welcome to RiseUp AI Technologies — a growing technology initiative exploring artificial intelligence, smart applications and bold digital ideas.</p>
  <div class="buttons">
    <a class="btn primary" href="#projects">Explore Projects ↗</a>
    <a class="btn secondary" href="#about">Meet the Founder</a>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="projects">
  <h2 class="section-title">What We're Building</h2>
  <p class="section-desc">A vision for useful, accessible technology.</p>
  <div class="cards">
    <div class="card">
      <div class="icon">🤖</div>
      <h3>RiseUp AI</h3>
      <p>An AI companion designed to explore ideas, support learning and make technology easier to use.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
      <div class="icon">💡</div>
      <h3>Future Innovations</h3>
      <p>New concepts and experiments focused on solving everyday problems with technology.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
      <div class="icon">📚</div>
      <h3>Learning & Creativity</h3>
      <p>Exploring tools that help people learn new skills, create and bring their ideas to life.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="about">
  <h2 class="section-title">Meet the Founder</h2>
  <p class="section-desc">Every big idea starts somewhere.</p>
  <div class="about">
    <div class="icon">💜</div>
    <h2>Created by Jahnavi</h2>
    <p>RiseUp AI Technologies is a personal technology initiative built with curiosity, creativity and a vision for the future. The journey begins with one idea and grows with every step.</p>
  </div>
</section>
</main>

<footer>
  <p>© 2026 <strong>RiseUp AI Technologies</strong></p>
  <p>Created with 💜 by Jahnavi</p>
</footer>
</body>
</html>
